  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-SNAP, tuned by TennCom, combines O-TORO Neon Pink 1.23 in the mains with O-TORO SNAP TOUR FLEX Black 1.25 in the crosses. The softer hexagonal O-TORO mains provide mechanical ball grip, spin and pocketing, while the firmer ultra-slick round crosses reduce inter-string friction and add support, control and crispness. This soft-firm contrast produces faster snapback, a more responsive feel and a lively, spin-friendly response designed for modern aggressive players.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-SNAP 由 TennCom 调校，采用 O-TORO Neon Pink 1.23 作为主线，搭配 O-TORO SNAP TOUR FLEX Black 1.25 作为横线。较柔和的六边形 O-TORO 主线负责咬球、旋转和 Pocketing，而更硬、超光滑的圆形 Tour Flex 横线则降低主横线摩擦，同时增加支撑、控制和 Crispness。Soft Main + Firm Cross 的结构能够带来更快 Snapback、更强响应和更清脆的击球反馈，整体是一套非常现代、偏旋转导向的双聚酯 Hybrid。"
  },

